<section class="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <div class="about-photo">
        <!--
          TODO(Maddie): Add your real photo to src/assets/ (e.g. maddie-photo.jpg), then
          replace the placeholder div below with:

            import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
            import maddiePhoto from '../assets/maddie-photo.jpg';
            ...
            <Image src={maddiePhoto} alt="Maddie Tavares" width={360} height={360} class="photo" />
        -->
        <div class="photo-frame postcard" role="img" aria-label="Placeholder for Maddie's photo">
            <span aria-hidden="true">📷</span>
            <p>your photo here</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-copy">
        <h2 id="about-heading">About Me</h2>
        <p>
            I'm Madilyn Tavares, or Maddie to everyone I know. I've spent 3 years writing
            professional code, and since May 2026 I've been studying the <strong>PERN stack</strong> (PostgreSQL, 
            Express, React, and Node.js), starting with a intensive bootcamp and now taking wing with my
            newfound skills. I've also gotten my hands dirty with <strong>Astro</strong> and <strong>Next.js</strong> along 
            the way.
        </p>
        <p>
            Before all that, I spent several years as a gameplay programmer working in <strong>C#</strong>, 
            mostly inside the Unity engine - a background that still contributes to how I design web code.
        </p>
        <p>
            Outside of code, you'll usually find me buried in an epic fantasy novel, keeping a nervous eye on MLB 
            wild card standings, or simply soaking up the lush vegetation of the Blue Ridge Mountains.
        </p>
        <p>
            Interested in having me build something for you? <a href="/contact">Let's talk.</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 280px) auto;
        gap: var(--space-4);
        align-items: start;
        justify-content: center;
        width: var(--page-content-width);
        margin: 0 0 var(--space-5) auto;
    }

    .photo-frame {
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5em;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
    }

    .photo-frame span {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .photo-frame p {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .about-copy p {
        max-width: 42rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .about {
            display: block;
            width: 80%;
            justify-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .photo-frame {
            width: min(180px, 70vw);
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .about-copy {
            margin-top: var(--space-4);
        }
    }
</style>
